{"id":"658434","name":"番茄菠萝肉","author":"莉莉呀Lilly","authorId":"12967468","desc":"","cover":"images/658434/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"猪肉","amount":"300g"}],"sub":[{"name":"菠萝","amount":"1个"},{"name":"番茄","amount":"5个"},{"name":"胡萝卜","amount":"1个"},{"name":"青椒","amount":"2个"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"番茄洗净切丁。","img":"images/658434/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"菠萝去皮。","img":"images/658434/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"切块后用清水冲洗一遍。","img":"images/658434/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"盐水浸泡备用。","img":"images/658434/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"胡萝卜切条，青椒切块备用。","img":"images/658434/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"猪肉切2厘米左右正方形。","img":"images/658434/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"加入6勺淀粉。","img":"images/658434/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"一勺食盐。","img":"images/658434/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"半勺味精。","img":"images/658434/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"加少许水混合均匀。","img":"images/658434/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"倒入250ml热锅烧油。","img":"images/658434/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"放入猪肉，炸至金黄。","img":"images/658434/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"变焦黄后捞出。","img":"images/658434/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"倒入青椒和胡萝卜20秒捞出热油另外用碗倒出装好。","img":"images/658434/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"番茄入锅，加水煮水没过西红柿。","img":"images/658434/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"煮软烂后捞出皮和渣。","img":"images/658434/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"放2勺白糖。","img":"images/658434/step_17.jpg"},{"step":18,"desc":"熬成番茄酱。","img":"images/658434/step_18.jpg"},{"step":19,"desc":"倒入炸好的肉和胡萝卜和青椒。","img":"images/658434/step_19.jpg"},{"step":20,"desc":"再放进盐水泡好的菠萝。","img":"images/658434/step_20.jpg"},{"step":21,"desc":"再放一勺盐。","img":"images/658434/step_21.jpg"},{"step":22,"desc":"翻炒均匀收汁出锅。","img":"images/658434/step_22.jpg"},{"step":23,"desc":"酸甜可口，开胃必备。","img":"images/658434/step_23.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}